 string quantum numbers map respectively to the integer and fractional winding quantum numbers of open strings ending on a D-brane array localized in the compactified directions. The closed string amplitudes factorize into products of open string scattering amplitudes with the open strings ending on a D-brane configuration determined by closed string data.","abstract_source_suggest":{"input":"arXiv"}}],"control_number":1850780,"dois":[{"source":"Springer","value":"10.1007/JHEP06(2021)057"},{"material":"publication","source":"arXiv","value":"10.1007/JHEP06(2021)057"}],"preprint_date":"2021-03-08","arxiv_eprints":[{"categories":["hep-th","math-ph","math.MP"],"value":"2103.05013"}],"titles":[{"source":"Springer","title":"KLT factorization of winding string amplitudes"},{"source":"arXiv","title":"KLT Factorization of Winding String Amplitudes"}],"document_type":["article"]},"id":"1850780","created":"2021-03-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"total":1},"links":{"self":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2103.05013&size=5&page=1&fields=titles,authors,dois,publication_info,arxiv_eprints,document_type,preprint_date,imprints,abstracts,urls","bibtex":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2103.05013&size=5&page=1&format=bibtex","latex-eu":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2103.05013&size=5&page=1&format=latex-eu","latex-us":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2103.05013&size=5&page=1&format=latex-us","json":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2103.05013&size=5&page=1&fields=titles,authors,dois,publication_info,arxiv_eprints,document_type,preprint_date,imprints,abstracts,urls&format=json","json-expanded":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2103.05013&size=5&page=1&format=json-expanded","cv":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2103.05013&size=5&page=1&format=cv"}}